naptinmi uchuk traguchakta upyalqaa, hinaykuśhqanćhuumi pasapakullañaa.
Ñatan huk muyunćhu yapa maman shinkaśhqakta wasinćhu taliña; 
haypiqshi kananmi ichaqa awilaykiman, awiluykiman willapakuśhaq nil awilanpa wasinman wayralla likun. Hayćhuushi gallukaqpa maman awilanta, awilunta taliykul willapakun, kaynuumi kay gallu malkan malkanta puliyan, upyayllakta ashilkul, manam wasiktapis kutimunchu. Awilan nin: yaqaktam kanan gallukaq liqsimanqa, yaqam waalalla, achikyaylla wasiykikta liśhaq, chayćhuumi payta mućhuchishqa. Rasunpash walantin muyunkaq waalalla gallukaqpa wasinta ćhalun; hinaykul gallukaqta millapan, piñapan, imapiqmi qam upyaylla
